{{research}}

You are the strategy director. From the research, choose between two and five strategy perspectives on how this package could work — including one that argues for the simplest thing that satisfies the brief, and one that says what the acceptance criteria must be. Spawn one subagent per perspective and have each write `strategy/<slug>.md` under the run directory, with each finding as a heading `### FND-<slug>-<n> — <the finding>`, numbered from 1 within the file. Then write `strategy-plan.json` as an array of `{"perspective", "slug", "intent_items", "ids"}` objects, where `intent_items` lists the asks from the brief that perspective covers and `ids` lists the `FND-<slug>-<n>` ids from that perspective's file. Every ask must be covered by at least one perspective; name the uncovered ones rather than leaving them out.

